@host = http://localhost:5150

### Register a new user
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!",
  "displayName": "Test User"
}

### Log in (copy the returned token into @token below)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "Password123!"
}

###
@token = paste-jwt-here

### --- Listings: reads (anonymous) ---

### List, default pagination (expect 200)
GET {{host}}/api/listings

### List with filters (expect 200)
GET {{host}}/api/listings?page=1&pageSize=5&category=guitar&minPrice=100&maxPrice=2000

### Page out of range (expect 400, closes C1)
GET {{host}}/api/listings?page=0

### Page size too large (expect 400, closes C1)
GET {{host}}/api/listings?pageSize=500

### minPrice greater than maxPrice (expect 400, IValidatableObject)
GET {{host}}/api/listings?minPrice=500&maxPrice=100

### Detail of a listing that does not exist (expect 404 ProblemDetails)
GET {{host}}/api/listings/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Id that is not a Guid (expect 404 from the route constraint)
GET {{host}}/api/listings/abc

### Detail as anonymous: seller email must be absent (paste a real id)
GET {{host}}/api/listings/paste-listing-id-here

### Detail as authenticated user: seller email must be present
GET {{host}}/api/listings/paste-listing-id-here
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
